  <!-- POST 2 -->
  <a class="post-card" href="/blog-post-2-the-loneliness.html">
    <div class="post-card-inner">
      <div class="post-category">The Solo Creative</div>
      <div class="post-title">The loneliness nobody talks about in music.</div>
      <p class="post-excerpt">There is a specific kind of alone that comes with building something in music by yourself. It doesn't have a name. But you know exactly what it feels like. And it's heavier than it needs to be.</p>
