      </div>
    </div>
  </a>

</div>

<!-- EMAIL SIGNUP -->
<section class="signup-section">
  <div class="signup-inner">
    <div class="signup-title">Get new posts in your inbox.</div>
    <p class="signup-sub">Short, honest, worth reading. New writing for solo music creatives every week. No fluff.</p>
    <div id="signup-wrap">
      <div class="signup-form">
        <input type="email" class="signup-input" id="blog-email" placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email"/>
